{
 "fps": 24,
 "duration": 53.667,
 "scenes": [
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "start": 0.0,
   "vo": "s1.wav",
   "vo_start": 0.5,
   "vo_len": 4.788,
   "slot": 5.625,
   "transition": {
    "type": "fade",
    "d": 0.5
   },
   "clip": 6.125,
   "text": "There's a shark in the Arctic... that is probably older than the United States."
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "start": 5.625,
   "vo": "s2.wav",
   "vo_start": 5.975,
   "vo_len": 4.127,
   "slot": 4.625,
   "transition": {
    "type": "fade",
    "d": 0.5
   },
   "clip": 5.125,
   "text": "It's called the Greenland shark. It lives in water close to freezing..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "start": 10.25,
   "vo": "s3.wav",
   "vo_start": 10.6,
   "vo_len": 2.133,
   "slot": 3.0416666666666665,
   "transition": {
    "type": "fade",
    "d": 0.6
   },
   "clip": 3.6417,
   "text": "and moves slower than you walk."
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "start": 13.2917,
   "vo": "s4.wav",
   "vo_start": 13.6917,
   "vo_len": 5.901,
   "slot": 6.583333333333333,
   "transition": {
    "type": "fade",
    "d": 0.5
   },
   "clip": 7.0833,
   "text": "For decades, no one could tell its age. Sharks don't have the bones scientists usually count."
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "start": 19.875,
   "vo": "s5.wav",
   "vo_start": 20.225,
   "vo_len": 3.502,
   "slot": 4.166666666666667,
   "transition": {
    "type": "zoomin",
    "d": 0.6
   },
   "clip": 4.7667,
   "text": "So in twenty sixteen, researchers looked into its eyes."
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "start": 24.0417,
   "vo": "s6.wav",
   "vo_start": 24.4417,
   "vo_len": 6.557,
   "slot": 7.291666666666667,
   "transition": {
    "type": "fadewhite",
    "d": 0.5
   },
   "clip": 7.7917,
   "text": "The core of the eye lens forms before birth, and never changes. Carbon dating it gave an answer."
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "start": 31.3333,
   "vo": "s7.wav",
   "vo_start": 31.8333,
   "vo_len": 5.852,
   "slot": 7.166666666666667,
   "transition": {
    "type": "cut",
    "d": 0.0
   },
   "clip": 7.1667,
   "text": "The largest shark they studied was around four hundred years old. Give or take a century."
  },
  {
   "id": "s8",
   "start": 38.5,
   "vo": "s8.wav",
   "vo_start": 38.85,
   "vo_len": 4.184,
   "slot": 4.916666666666667,
   "transition": {
    "type": "fadeblack",
    "d": 0.6
   },
   "clip": 5.5167,
   "text": "And it doesn't become an adult until it's about one hundred and fifty."
  },
  {
   "id": "s9",
   "start": 43.4167,
   "vo": "s9.wav",
   "vo_start": 43.8667,
   "vo_len": 5.804,
   "slot": 7.666666666666667,
   "transition": {
    "type": "fade",
    "d": 0.6
   },
   "clip": 8.2667,
   "text": "So the oldest ones down there were young before the steam engine... and they're still in no hurry."
  },
  {
   "id": "end",
   "start": 51.0833,
   "slot": 2.5833333333333335,
   "transition": {
    "type": "none",
    "d": 0
   },
   "clip": 2.5833,
   "text": ""
  }
 ],
